rule early v1
description "Whether a day is in the first half of 2026: a date input that may not be left out"

inputs
  on : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-12-31

outputs
  early : bool

table early_of
policy unique
| on           | -> early |
| <2026-07-01  | true     |
| >=2026-07-01 | false    |

examples
| on         | -> early |
| 2026-02-01 | true     |
| 2026-09-01 | false    |
